window.docContents[5].resolve({"/rules/RG1001/#RG1001-fix":{"contents":"1. If the statement is provable, prove it: replace axiom name : P by theorem name : P := proof.2. If it is a genuine assumption of a model, make it a parameter: theorem result (h : P) : Q, or a field of a structure that bundles the model and its laws.3. If it states an open research target, define it as a Prop (def Target : Prop := P) and state results conditionally on it; do not assert it.\n\n","context":"Regula rule reference\u0009Rule index\u0009RG1001: Project logical axioms are forbidden","header":"How to fix it","id":"/rules/RG1001/#RG1001-fix"}});